# Message history, unread state and contacts survive a restart.
node Finn 7 echo
as Finn advert
wait 3000
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
key right
key enter
type First message
key enter
wait 5000
hold esc 900
as Finn dm Cardputer Unread after reboot
wait 3000
expect unread 1
reboot
wait 2000
expect contacts 1
expect threads 1
expect unread 1
shot history-after-reboot
key enter
shot history-thread
expect unread 0
